  <item>
    <title>Godflesh – Decay</title>
    <link>https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/godflesh-decay/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/godflesh-decay/</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 04:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <enclosure url="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6ab41594272200043ff4eb82/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Godflesh-%20Decay.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>For decades, industrial metal titan Justin K. Broadrick screamed so hard that it shredded his insides. He softens his attack on the band’s penultimate album, but they’re not going out gently.</p>
<img src="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6ab41594272200043ff4eb82/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Godflesh-%20Decay.jpg" alt="Decay cover"/>
<img src="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6ab41594272200043ff4eb82/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Godflesh-%20Decay.jpg" alt="Decay cover"/>]]></description>
  </item>
